      "title_original": "How Specializing the Vocabulary of SLMs Can Cut Inference Cost by 77% in Real Applications",
      "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
      "published_at": "2026-10-21T17:35:36+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://huggingface.co/blog/Dharma-AI/vocabx-vocabulary-specialization",
      "category": "ai",
      "original_language": "en",
      "what_happened": "Dharma-AI预览了VocabX成果：在基于Qwen和Gemma等微调开源模型的生产级作文评分器中，围绕token成本而非频率专门化分词器词表，在不更换基础模型的情况下将实测推理成本降低77%。",
      "what_happened_en": "Dharma-AI previewed VocabX results: specializing tokenizer vocabulary around token cost rather than frequency cut measured inference cost by 77% without changing the base model, in a production essay grader built on fine-tuned open-source models such as Qwen and Gemma.",
      "why_it_matters": "这表明分词器词表可以成为领域专用模型的重要成本杠杆。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "It shows tokenizer vocabulary can be a major cost lever for domain-specialized models.",
