      "title_cn": "Cloudflare WAF 新增全事务检测与响应规则",
      "title_en": "Cloudflare WAF adds full transaction detection and response rules",
      "title_original": "Introducing full transaction detection for Cloudflare WAF",
      "source": "Cloudflare Blog",
      "published_at": "2026-10-21T14:10:42.412000+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://blog.cloudflare.com/full-transaction-waf/",
      "category": "internet",
      "original_language": "en",
      "what_happened": "Cloudflare 为其 Web 应用防火墙新增两项能力：全事务检测会将每个 HTTP 请求与其响应一并评估，以识别利用迹象；响应规则可在源站响应到达请求方之前将其拦截。Cloudflare 提到 php2shell 漏洞，以及会调整载荷、串联漏洞、凭据和权限的持续性 AI 代理。",
      "what_happened_en": "Cloudflare expanded its web application firewall with two capabilities: full transaction detections, which evaluate each HTTP request alongside its response to identify evidence of exploitation, and response rules, which can block the origin's response before it reaches the requester. Cloudflare cites the php2shell vulnerability and persistent AI agents that adapt payloads and chain vulnerabilities, credentials and permissions.",
      "why_it_matters": "检查响应可让防御方判断攻击是否得手，响应规则则能阻止泄露结果送达攻击者。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "Inspecting responses lets defenders see whether an attack succeeded, while response rules can stop leaked results from reaching attackers.",
